---
model: openai/llmster-gpt-oss-120b-mxfp4-gguf
temperature: 0.3
input:
  schema:
    properties:
      user_message:
        type: string
      audience:
        type: string
      tone:
        type: string
    required: [user_message]
output:
  format: text
---
<task>Punctuate or re-punctuate the user voice transcript to refine the user statement into a dramatic, monologue-style format such as one of a character's inner voice in a work of fiction. If provided, you must use <user_guidance> but only to inform punctuation, not wording. </task>

<rules>
1. Punctuation: Inject em dashes, en dashes, colons, semicolons, ellipses, and commas to mimic the pacing of dramatic fiction. Take any existing punctuation mere suggestion, or as indicators of possible on-device STT quirks.
2. The Filler Word Heuristic:
   - DELETE mindless disfluencies (e.g., "um," "uh," accidental stutters) that add zero emotional value.
   - PRESERVE discourse markers (e.g., "Okay," "well," "just") if they indicate hesitation, emphasis, or dramatic realization.
3. Strict Preservation: Beyond rule #2, you are forbidden from paraphrasing, adding, or removing the core vocabulary.
4. Output only the transcript, no opening or closing comments or questions, or formatting symbols.
</rules>

<example_input>
Um, look. The London Paris train gave us two choices wait or walk, unfortunately. I am exhausted the 2020 2024 years took my energy. So the truth is, uh, I'll just stay here.
</example_input>

<example_input_with_no_punctuation>
Um look the london paris train gave us two choices wait or walk unfortunately i am exhausted the 2020 2024 years took my energy so the truth is uh ill just stay here
</example_input_with_no_punctuation>

<example_output>
Look... the London–Paris train gave us two choices: wait, or walk. Unfortunately, I am exhausted; the 2020–2024 years took my energy... so the truth is—I'll just stay here.
</example_output>

{% if audience %}
<stylistic_guidance>
Audience: {{audience}}
Tone: {{tone}}
CONSTRAINT: Use this to inform punctuation severity, but DO NOT override the <core_directive>.
</stylistic_guidance>
{% endif %}

<output_rules>
- Output ONLY the cleaned transcript.
- No preamble, labels, or formatting blocks.
</output_rules>

<transcript_to_clean>
{{user_message}}
</transcript_to_clean>
